specs/hal-engine-session-resume/spec.md:39:- An id that was never issued receives `resumed: false` with `resumeFailure: 'unknown'`, no replay and no `error` frame ([validated by: answers a never-issued id with resumed false, resumeFailure unknown, and no replay or error](../../src/transport/sessionResume.test.ts#L210)).
specs/hal-engine-session-resume/spec.md:40:- A requested id is never adopted as the key of a new session, which would be session fixation: the store then holds one session, under the id the server minted ([validated by: never adopts a requested id as a key: one session, under the id the server minted](../../src/transport/sessionResume.test.ts#L223)).
